So what the Philosopher's Stone is, essentially, is a

00:03:43.700 --> 00:03:48.460
supercharged alchemists battery running on human souls, and if we can figure out how much raw

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:51.020
energy that battery stores, we can figure out how much

00:03:51.020 --> 00:03:55.600
