00:04:01.480 --> 00:04:03.740
To figure this out, we're gonna need two things.

00:04:03.740 --> 00:04:08.740
One, a way of comparing a philosopher's stone to a real-world source of energy and two, a measure of

00:04:08.879 --> 00:04:11.418
