00:04:12.120 --> 00:04:15.340
Fortunately for us theorists, FMA: brotherhood gives us the chance

00:04:15.340 --> 00:04:18.769
to calculate both. In episode 19, one of the homunculi, Lust,

00:04:19.440 --> 00:04:22.429
stabs Colonel Roy Mustang in the gut and leaves him for dead.

00:04:22.680 --> 00:04:24.606
